{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging all her life, Callana finds a buried bunker underground. She explores the bunker and finds an AI mech named Misery. Together they fight their way out and seek help. Will you guide Callana towards the path of mercy or end the knights of Lord Shiv who try to stop you? It's up to you to decide Callana's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943990/extras/1d23143ccb51fdb4448090ed134bf798.avif?t=1759544764\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1806 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill or Mercy Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing path is a short non-canon story following Callana who takes Misery's advice to kill and how it effects the story. It doesn't tell you much about the story however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercy is the canon ending where you find out more about the world you're living in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress throughout the story you'll learn many colorful characters; each their own unique personalities and designs so no two are similar.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943990?t=1759544764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943990?t=1759544764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943990/26c9a6ba41bc59c1e266aa03bf397961dbc1341e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759544764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943990/26c9a6ba41bc59c1e266aa03bf397961dbc1341e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759544764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging all her life, Callana finds a buried bunker underground. She explores the bunker and finds an AI mech named Misery. Together they fight their way out and seek help. Will you guide Callana towards the path of mercy or end the knights of Lord Shiv who try to stop you? It's up to you to decide Callana's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943990/extras/1d23143ccb51fdb4448090ed134bf798.avif?t=1759544764\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1806 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill or Mercy Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing path is a short non-canon story following Callana who takes Misery's advice to kill and how it effects the story. It doesn't tell you much about the story however.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercy is the canon ending where you find out more about the world you're living in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress throughout the story you'll learn many colorful characters; each their own unique personalities and designs so no two are similar.</p>","developers":["Hookening"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943990/0516b4dd6a70846dabecd952980d080479247bf7/header.jpg?t=1759544764","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943990/158620720/8b9e54a6ea2e3b87f1fcc2318ad9b45a32a4fb5e/1754714211/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759544762","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943990/158620720/8b9e54a6ea2e3b87f1fcc2318ad9b45a32a4fb5e/1754714211/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759544762","highlight":tr